title: Cabinet
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
card-image: img/muller_cabinet.jpg
view-if: difficulty < 0 and spd_in_government and chancellor_party = "SPD"
on-arrival: last_cabinet_action = 1; 
new-page: true 

= Cabinet

With an SPD chancellor and SPD cabinet members, we can direct the affairs of the national government.

- #cabinet
- @lobbying
- @back: Return to main

@back
on-arrival: last_cabinet_action = 0
go-to: root

@lobbying
subtitle: We could lobby our partners. ( -2 resources and drop in relation)
view-if: lobbying_active >= 1 and lobbying_timer <= 0

Whichever ministry should we lobby?

- #lobby_target
- @cabinet: Back

@lobby_foreign_minister
title: Lobby the [+ foreign_minister_party +] — Foreign Ministry
tags: lobby_target
view-if: lobby_foreign_minister_available >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
var party = (Q.foreign_minister_party || '').toLowerCase();
Q[party + '_relation'] -= 5;
!}
go-to: foreign_policy

@lobby_interior_minister
title: Lobby the [+ interior_minister_party +] — Interior Ministry
tags: lobby_target
view-if: lobby_interior_minister_available >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
var party = (Q.interior_minister_party || '').toLowerCase();
Q[party + '_relation'] -= 5;
!}
go-to: police

@lobby_justice_minister
title: Lobby the [+ justice_minister_party +] — Justice Ministry
tags: lobby_target
view-if: lobby_justice_minister_available >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
var party = (Q.justice_minister_party || '').toLowerCase();
Q[party + '_relation'] -= Q.random_factor(10);
!}
go-to: judiciary

